# The Android release keystore and its passwords never enter the repository. The
# keystore file itself lives OUTSIDE both repos (D:\AI PRO\safenest-keystore\).
# Lose it and every existing install must uninstall/reinstall — Android refuses an
# update whose signing key changed. Back it up offline.
android/key.properties
*.jks
*.keystore

# NOTE: firebase.env is deliberately NOT ignored — see the file itself. It holds
# only the identifiers that Google publishes inside every shipped APK anyway.
# The thing that must never be committed is the SERVICE ACCOUNT key, which lives
# outside both repos entirely.
